  "id": "inlay_hints/parameter_hints/05_reference_markers",
  "topic": "inlay_hints",
  "subtopic": "parameter_hints",
  "title": "Mutable reference markers",
  "summary": "`&` flags arguments passed by non-const lvalue reference",
  "prose": "The marker has a switch of its own, `inlay_hints.mutable_references`: with parameter names turned off it stays, in front of an empty name.",
  "status": "supported",
  "issues": [
    "clangd#1123"
  ],
  "files": [
