      "path": "main.cpp",
      "text": "void mutate(int& value);\nvoid observe(const int& value);\nvoid take(int&& value);\n\nvoid use() {\n    int v = 0;\n    mutate(v);\n    observe(v);\n    take(static_cast<int&&>(v));\n}\n",
      "markers": []
    }
  ],
